---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="What's New" description="Recent updates and new features on ajew.org - the largest online Breslov Torah library.">
  <section class="updates-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>What's New</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Recent updates to ajew.org</p>

      <div class="update-list">
        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">May 2026</div>
          <h2>Site Renovation &amp; New Features</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Tikun HaKlali page — all 10 Psalms with Hebrew, transliteration &amp; English</li>
            <li>Complete homepage redesign — Na Nach hero, daily quote, quick-start cards</li>
            <li>Ask page fixed — redirects to advanced search with Hebrew terms</li>
            <li>Empty landing page bug fixed</li>
            <li>All 36,470 pages rebuilt and deployed</li>
            <li>Navigation shell with desktop sidebar + mobile tab bar</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">March 2026</div>
          <h2>Massive Library Expansion</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>213 books now online with 30,000+ pages</li>
            <li>Full Tanach (39 books, 929 chapters) with nikud</li>
            <li>Talmud Bavli (39 tractates, 5,400 dapim)</li>
            <li>Mishna (57 tractates, 3,847 mishnayot)</li>
            <li>Rambam Mishneh Torah (14 books, 15,017 halachot)</li>
            <li>Zohar HaKadosh (8 volumes, 1,930 pages)</li>
            <li>Musar & Halacha texts (8 books)</li>
            <li>Siach Sarfei Kodesh (6 volumes, 3,427 pages)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">March 2026</div>
          <h2>English Translations</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Likutay Moharan: 100% complete (411/411 torahs)</li>
            <li>Likutay Halachos: 95% (567/600)</li>
            <li>Sefer HaMidos: 98%</li>
            <li>Sipurey Maasiyos: 96%</li>
            <li>Shivchay HaRan: 98%</li>
            <li>Hashtatfchus HaNefesh: 79%</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">March 2026</div>
          <h2>Reader Features</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Listen (text-to-speech) with L keyboard shortcut</li>
            <li>Clickable source references with verse popup</li>
            <li>Share & Print buttons</li>
            <li>Reading history with progress tracking</li>
            <li>Daily learning (LM + Tehillim cycle)</li>
            <li>Random Torah button</li>
            <li>Concept tags on each teaching</li>
            <li>Scroll position memory</li>
            <li>Text selection copy/share popup</li>
            <li>Offline support (Service Worker)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">March 2026</div>
          <h2>Search & Tools</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>10 search modes: Google, Exact, All/Any word, Proximity, Boolean, Acronym, End-letters, Starts/Ends with</li>
            <li>Min match (e.g. at least 3 of 5 words)</li>
            <li>Nikud-aware highlighting</li>
            <li>Torah Map with concept progression pathways</li>
            <li>Gematria calculator</li>
            <li>Quick verse reference lookup (Tanach + Talmud)</li>
            <li>Yahrzeit notifications</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="update-card">
          <div class="update-date">March 2026</div>
          <h2>Performance & UX</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>58MB image optimization (gallery)</li>
            <li>Caching headers for faster repeat visits</li>
            <li>PWA support (Add to Home Screen)</li>
            <li>404 page, skip-to-content, ARIA roles</li>
            <li>Active nav indicator, back-to-top button</li>
            <li>Press / to search from any page</li>
            <li>Collapsible library categories</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .updates-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px 80px;
    font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Frank Ruhl Libre', serif;
    color: #1a365d;
    font-size: 2em;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .subtitle { color: #666; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .update-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .update-card {
    background: #f8f5ef;
    border: 1px solid #e0d6c2;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }
  .update-date {
    font-size: 0.8em;
    color: #888;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .update-card h2 {
    font-family: 'Frank Ruhl Libre', serif;
    color: #1a365d;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .update-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 20px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #444;
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }
</style>
